If you robbed a shop, there are two possibilities:
 
1) the shopkeeper is peaceful:
"Beware, Taikuri!  I am upset about missing stock!"
 
2) he runs after you and hits you:
"Hello, Taikuri!  Didn't you forget to pay?"
Asidonhopo doesn't like customers who don't pay.
Asidonhopo is after blood, not money! 
 
I found a easy trick to avoid this: shopkeeper don't fall in pits!
So you apply your pick axe (that already made your way through
the shop walls) and dig some pits around the shop keeper. 
 
----------          (Be careful and don't dig holes!!!)
|........|          So the shopkeeper will not move. You can even 
|......^^-####      kill him with a wand (striking, fire, ...)
|......^@| #
